WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,420
This group of people must be killed.

2
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:10,860
Now that everyone is here

3
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:21,110
Let's go in quickly. Okay. What's going on? Don't panic.

4
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:23,150
Maybe you can only get out through this copy

5
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,750
You have chosen to challenge Lang Chu

6
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:26,150
Hounds of Dallos

7
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,470
Failure will lead to death

8
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,950
Escape will be rewarded generously

9
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,310
When the wolf is close to you

10
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,510
Will trigger heartbeat

11
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:33,150
Hit three times by his attacks

12
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,510
Will enter a state of shock

13
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:37,030
